WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.050 --> 00:01:49.750
Someone once said:

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:55.060
There are fruity, first-rate 
tomatoes with a high sugar content

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:58.060
that are the heads of lizards...

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:01.530
Reptomatoes!

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:07.740
There are fragrant, giant crunchy 
spring rolls with long skins

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:11.670
that are the necks of giraffes...

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:16.040
Springiraffe Rolls!

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:20.110
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:20.410 --> 00:02:25.750
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:32.030
Toriko Rushes In! The Truth 
of the Gourmet World!

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:39.800
Okay, this is it!

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:41.500
How about this one?!

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:44.100
The perfect rock to test my strength, right?!

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:47.340
How big is it?!

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:52.610
It's a pretty good-sized iron ore, isn't it?

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:56.280
I've got no complaints about its 
hardness or durability either.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:05.260
My cells that evolved even 
more with the Ozone Grass...

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:09.060
Show me your power so I can measure it!

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:13.600
13... 14...

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:16.570
15-fold...

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:18.570
...Spiked Punch!

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.520
Go!

00:03:37.390 --> 00:03:39.720
Yeah!!

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:42.590
How was that, Komatsu?! Terry?!

00:03:42.590 --> 00:03:45.230
T-Too amazing!

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.100
Alright! What do you say we eat?!

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:55.410
I give thanks to this world's great bounty!

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.540
Thanks for the food!

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:08.790
Delicious! The meat tastes like 
light, first-rate chicken!

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:13.160
And yet, it's overflowing 
with sweet, juicy fat!

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:16.460
And the skin is crispy and 
aromatic, like Peking duck!

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:19.800
Yeah! It's wonderful, isn't it, Toriko-san?

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:23.130
I picked a Miso Fruit before,

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:25.400
and inside is a Miso Fava Bean,

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:29.310
so how about using it to 
season the meat like so...

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.810
Yahoo! Grilled miso!

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:35.710
It's making my mouth water!

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:46.390
I can't get enough! The miso 
enriches the flavor of the meat!

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:50.560
And the delightful aroma of the Miso 
Fava Bean is spreading to my mouth!

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.590
Good going, Komatsu!

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:54.230
Thank you!

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:56.460
Alright! Let's keep cookin' more meat!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.800
Sure, Toriko-san!

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:09.110
Toriko! After this, I'm going 
into the Gourmet World.

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.510
If you boys feel up to it...

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:14.180
...make yourselves stronger, then follow me!

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:23.090
I think it's still a little too 
early for Komatsu and Terry...

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:28.700
The Gourmet World...

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:32.600
Just how far would I get with 
the level I'm at now...?

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:34.500
I wanna know.

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:36.700
I really wanna know...

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.900
Mmm, delicious!

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:05.360
Chestnut Sea Urchin pasta is the best!

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:10.000
For one thing, what a nice environment...

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:13.140
Raintown, where the rain 
never stops falling...

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:17.340
The constant humidity brings out 
the rich yet mild flavor even more.

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:20.310
And the jazz music playing 
faintly in the background

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:22.450
along with the sound of the rain outside...

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:24.750
They all blend in with the antique decor,

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:29.390
producing an ineffably 
peaceful, relaxing mood.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:33.290
In other words, this place has harmony.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:37.860
You understand, Toriko? Harmony. Harmony!

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:44.140
Another one of the same!

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:46.040
Just keep the dishes comin'!

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.410
You haven't heard a word I said!

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:51.680
And as always, the way you eat 
doesn't have one iota of beauty!

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:55.080
Honestly... I was in the middle of 
training, but I came here for you...

00:06:55.910 --> 00:06:58.150
More importantly, Sunny...

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.890
Oh, what you mentioned before...

00:07:01.320 --> 00:07:03.420
Are you serious?

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:07.060
You want to enter the Gourmet World...?

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:22.640
Recently, Chef Komatsu has been 
totally fired up, you know?

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:27.840
Yeah. I suppose it's because he teamed 
up with that Gourmet Hunter, Toriko.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.010
He even created Century Soup...

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.850
He really is amazing!

00:07:32.320 --> 00:07:33.520
Chef Komatsu!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.590
It looks like an acquaintance 
of yours is here...

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.120
Oh, thank you. Who could it be?

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.360
T-Tina-san?!

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.960
That's terrific for you!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:53.240
I heard about it, Komatsu-kun!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:56.910
You and Toriko are partners?! 
Congratulations!

00:07:57.440 --> 00:08:00.240
Yes, thank you.

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:02.410
Come on, tell me about it!

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:04.080
An exclusive interview!

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.180
What led up to it?

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:07.880
Did you ask him, Chef?

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.750
What do you two dream of doing?

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:12.650
Er... I don't...

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.490
An interview...?

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:19.530
But my immediate goal is to get stronger...

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:23.200
Because one day I'm going with 
Toriko to the Gourmet World!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:25.230
G-Gourmet World?!

00:08:26.930 --> 00:08:27.700
Yes!

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:29.770
The Gourmet World, seriously?!

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:32.140
That's a jumbo heaping helping of danger!

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:35.640
You know about that famous press 
conference from a long time ago, right?

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:42.380
The subject was the truth 
about the Gourmet World...

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:46.750
Long, long ago, the Gourmet World 
was called "Food Paradise".

00:08:47.150 --> 00:08:51.260
But then a certain journalist 
exploded that established theory.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:55.430
His name... was Hatch.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:59.470
The Gourmet World is no Utopia...

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:01.940
It's just Hell!

00:09:02.940 --> 00:09:04.870
The Gourmet Sea is rough...

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:06.910
And so is the sky!

00:09:08.040 --> 00:09:10.310
That haphazard weather...

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:14.810
Even for a qualified weather forecaster 
with navigational skills like me...

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:17.580
I couldn't make heads or tails of it.

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:19.720
But more than anything...

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:23.060
The savage beasts that inhabit the place!

00:09:23.990 --> 00:09:27.660
I bet that no matter what 
weapons we brought there,

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:29.500
it wouldn't have the 
slightest effect on them!

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:32.430
H-How did you make it home?

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:36.340
I was just incredibly 
lucky. It was by chance...

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:41.040
No. It was a miracle that I escaped death.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:45.040
What gave his testimony credibility was that

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:49.180
he was once a top-ranked 
Gourmet Hunter himself.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:55.390
He was the first person to ever 
return from the Gourmet World.

00:09:56.990 --> 00:10:00.360
Before, everyone thought that the 
Gourmet World was like a paradise

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:02.890
with such a heaping helping of 
charm that explorers settled there.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:06.530
But the truth was they all died, 
so they couldn't come home.

00:10:07.430 --> 00:10:09.370
After that press conference,

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.640
everyone's conception of the 
Gourmet World changed completely.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:16.740
Soon, the IGO put up barriers all over,

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:19.340
separating the Human World 
from the Gourmet World.

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:23.450
And then, they designated all of 
the Gourmet World a "danger zone".

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:28.320
While the Gourmet World is a 
treasure trove of new ingredients,

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:31.690
it's also the entrance to Hell, 
from which there's no return.

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:35.590
Yeah. Of course, I know all that.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:38.760
I know how terrifying it is...

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:42.400
But I'll be fine if I'm with Toriko-san.

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:44.600
I'm sure...

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:50.640
Sunny...

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:54.040
You've been in the Gourmet 
World before, haven't you?

00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:58.310
As I recall, you were 
after an ingredient there.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:05.650
Earth. Acacia's dessert.

00:11:06.090 --> 00:11:07.320
Earth?!

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:09.530
Yes.

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:15.800
Fool!

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:18.700
How many times have I told you 
that it's too early for you

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:20.470
to go into the Gourmet World with 
your abilities as they are now?!

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:24.710
I tell ya, if I hadn't gone in 
there to rescue you, you'd be dead!

00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:26.740
I'm not gonna die...

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:34.250
Anyway, I had to see for myself... 
or I never would've been satisfied.

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:38.250
Yeah, I went in there.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:41.490
The Gourmet World wasn't 
as big a deal as I thought.

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:44.960
I kinda figured! So, where'd you get in?

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:46.590
Tell me the location.

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:50.260
Toriko, you're the same as me, aren't you?

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:55.640
If I tried to hold you back, it's not 
in your nature to readily submit.

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:59.410
And that wouldn't be beautiful, anyway...

00:12:00.310 --> 00:12:01.210
Toriko...

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:05.810
There are three routes to 
the Gourmet World from land.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:09.280
Zirbel Island, with its "Life Basin"...

00:12:09.720 --> 00:12:12.690
Yuto Island, with its 
"Bay of Evil Spirits"...

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:16.060
And Wac Continent, with 
its "Road of Three Hells".

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:20.330
Among the three, the route 
with the fewest obstacles

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:23.100
and the one that's called the easiest 
way into the Gourmet World...

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:27.000
That's Zirbel Island, through its Life Basin.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:31.140
Life Basin, huh? Thanks, Sunny!

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:32.510
Do you intend to go alone?

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:37.180
Naturally. I can't take 
Komatsu or Terry there yet.

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:40.910
I'm going to put my strength to the test.

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:45.680
So make sure you keep it 
a secret from the old man!

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:46.590
See you!

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:49.220
Hey, Toriko!

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:50.760
Oh, that's right!

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:53.090
The food was delicious!

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:55.460
Thank you for the meal!

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:57.300
I'm paying?!

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:59.100
You're the one who wanted to meet!

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:00.930
Jeez...

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:02.930
On his own...

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:06.100
Don't do anything rash, Toriko.

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.950
Zirbel Island...

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:20.750
Life Basin...

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:26.390
Here I come, Gourmet World!

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.910
The Gourmet World...

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:46.710
Chef Komatsu...

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:49.950
I see an acquaintance of yours is here...

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:51.780
Uh, thank you.

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.580
I'm getting a lot of visitors today.

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:08.630
We're getting many skillful 
people these days.

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:13.340
But I never imagined the great Gourmet 
Hunter, Toriko, would show up today.

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:17.440
Sorry about this. But I appreciate you 
letting me through without any problems.

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:20.440
Not at all.

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:25.250
There's no reason to stand in the 
way of a Gourmet Hunter's work.

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:33.090
Besides that, it was wise to choose 
this route to enter the Gourmet World.

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:39.190
At any rate, the huge Gourmet World takes 
up about 70% of the world's surface.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.860
Due to its abnormal weather 
and particular magnetic field,

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:47.070
Human World / Gourmet World

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:47.070
not even satellites can capture images of it.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:50.340
The only way to get information 
about the Gourmet World

00:14:50.340 --> 00:14:52.670
is by actually entering it.

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:57.680
However... it's impossible 
to get in by air or sea.

00:14:57.680 --> 00:15:02.350
At the borderline of the Human 
World is the Current of Death,

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:03.980
where a poison tide runs...

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:09.760
On the borderline high in the air is a 
wall formed by an enormous cyclone...

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:13.360
Of the three remaining routes,

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:17.830
you could certainly say that 
Zirbel Island here is the safest.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:21.640
Although that's only 
compared to the others...

00:15:21.640 --> 00:15:34.450
Human World / Gourmet World

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:25.740
This area has a vast difference in sea level

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:28.510
between the Human World 
and the Gourmet World.

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:31.210
Because of that, the wild 
animals of the Gourmet World

00:15:31.210 --> 00:15:34.310
don't usually climb up to the Human World.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:43.590
That being said, there are hardly ever 
any beasts curious enough to come over.

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:53.470
Do you know why that is... Toriko-sama?

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:57.200
The food on the Gourmet World 
side is tastier, right?

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.270
That's the only possibility.

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:05.080
It's said that in that world, where 
the law of the jungle prevails,

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:08.880
even beasts that are hunted down 
rarely enter the Human World.

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:16.350
And yet, humans never cease 
going from here to there...

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:22.590
They know the Gourmet World is the 
entrance to Hell, but every year,

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:28.030
hundreds of challengers take the 
plunge from this 18th Barrier.

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:31.700
And almost none return...

00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:36.610
It's as if everyone is jumping 
in to lose their lives.

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:44.380
That's the reason this is 
called the "Life Basin".

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:48.350
And even so, they make the plunge.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.550
The reason is simple.

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:54.120
The Gourmet World has a ton of ingredients

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:58.360
that people are willing to 
risk their lives to get!

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:06.040
Except I ain't gonna die!

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.070
Toriko-sama!

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.010
Chief!

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:14.040
This time, a famous person says he 
wants to enter the Gourmet World!

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:14.880
What?!

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:25.660
The Gourmet World at last!

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.890
I'll test my abilities!

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:33.630
W-What the...?!

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:52.050
Breath Dragon (Unknown Type) 
Capture Level Unmeasurable

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:05.690
Flying Fork!

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:13.430
I-It doesn't reach?!

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:15.200
Wha...?!

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:23.810
I'll be damned... if I'm gonna die here...

00:18:29.950 --> 00:18:32.820
Bring it on, Gourmet World!

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:36.020
I'll give you everything I've got!

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:04.180
Just how many meters did I fall?!

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:07.490
I was going at a speed of 200 km 
an hour for several minutes...

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:10.060
Does a place like that really exist?

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:12.790
What the hell is this place?

00:19:19.430 --> 00:19:21.530
I can't move...

00:19:21.930 --> 00:19:24.170
W-What the...?

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:26.270
My body... is heavy!

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:13.080
Sabrina

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.320
Pa-pa-pa-para

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:18.160
Sabrina

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:27.260
Rainy day, danced down on the night city

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:34.140
You had deep red lipstick on you

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:37.910
Like you were toyed with

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:41.340
Like you were tasted

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:48.450
A solitary silhouette seen through the glass

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:55.190
One day, one day... Search for true love

00:20:55.190 --> 00:21:02.260
Even if hurt by the lies going around town

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:07.000
Rottening fruit

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.570
Sabrina

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:14.510
Gourmet News!

00:21:15.610 --> 00:21:17.180
I'm your host, Tina!

00:21:17.180 --> 00:21:19.480
Today, I'll be making 
Chestnut Sea Urchin pasta!

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:23.150
I wanna eat in a stylish 
European-style restaurant.

00:21:23.150 --> 00:21:26.250
As might be expected, they serve Euro-pasta!

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:31.030
Let's use that lame gag as a segue...

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:34.560
It seems like you're in trouble, Signora!

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:36.530
I've been waiting for that voice!

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.480
Buon giorno!

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:55.120
The Fantasista of the 
Kitchen, Taccino Kawagoe!

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:57.620
Your entrance has gotten fancy!

00:22:00.550 --> 00:22:05.690
Si! Today, I'll introduce you to a 
fantastic recipe so you can enjoy

00:22:05.690 --> 00:22:09.200
the taste of Chestnut Sea Urchin 
style pasta made the simple way.

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:10.400
Please!

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:13.570
First, fry up some bacon in a pan.

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:17.440
Then add chicken soup and fresh cream.

00:22:17.770 --> 00:22:21.610
Next, put in noodles that have already 
been boiled and turn off the stove.

00:22:22.210 --> 00:22:24.780
Add in an egg yolk, several 
drops of soy sauce,

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:25.210
and Parmesan cheese, then stir it well.

00:22:28.250 --> 00:22:33.450
Finally, mix in two tablespoons of pudding...

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:37.690
Taccino Fantasy!

00:22:37.460 --> 00:22:41.430
Sweet Carbonara

00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:41.430
Sweet Carbonara!

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:49.570
A heaping helping of buono!

00:22:49.570 --> 00:22:53.840
Next time, I'll come help you 
in your kitchen, Signora!

00:22:59.380 --> 00:23:01.680
This is marvelous!

00:23:02.450 --> 00:23:04.580
N-Now on to the next story!

00:23:07.270 --> 00:23:09.990
Toriko hears a shout on the verge of his doom in the Gourmet World.

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:13.920
Overflowing dandyism… And the true nature of Knocking.

00:23:14.140 --> 00:23:17.430
Enter the Astounding Ringer! The True Meaning of a Partner!

00:23:17.670 --> 00:23:19.400
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
